notes = "(!) Put the ROMs in system/pom2.|(!) Automatic machine: //e Enhanced, then //e, //c, ][+ by available firmware; a WOZ disk's INFO or META chunk picks its own.|(!) Cheats: ADDR:VV, ADDR?CC:VV or AAAAAAVV in the RetroAchievements address space (aux RAM at $10000).|(!) Netplay: set Port 3 to Keyboard (for netplay) for keyboard games."
description = "Apple ][, ][+, //e, //e Enhanced, //c and //c Plus, NTSC and PAL. Disk II (WOZ, NIB, DSK, D13), 3.5-inch SmartPort, ProDOS hard disks (HDV), Mockingboard, AppleMouse, Le Chat Mauve RGB, eleven displays from composite to OpenEmulator and AppleWin NTSC, ShrinkIt, DiskCopy 4.2 and A2R flux captures, cassette tapes that load themselves, private writable disks, M3U playlists, save states, rewind, RetroAchievements memory map, cheats and a RetroPad keyboard."
